<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">NPN: Non-Linear Projections of the Null-Space 
<br class="ltx_break">for Imaging Inverse Problems</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Roman Jacome<span id="footnotex1" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">1</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">1</sup>
          <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">1</span>
          
          
          
