<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Ablation over <math id="S5.T3.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> for two methods. Best results are <span id="S5.T3.fig1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFDFDF;">bold teal</span>; second-best are <span id="S5.T3.fig1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_underline" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFDFBF;">underline orange</span>.</figcaption>
