</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS8.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS8.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS8.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DiffPIR <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib65" title="" class="ltx_ref">65</a>]</cite>.</span> <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{n}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{n}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the standard deviation of the measurement noise, <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> is the data–proximal penalty that trades off data fidelity and the denoiser prior inside the subproblem; <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho_{i}\triangleq\lambda,\sigma_{n}^{2}/\tilde{\sigma}_{i}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≜</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho_{i}\triangleq\lambda,\sigma_{n}^{2}/\tilde{\sigma}_{i}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> is the iteration-dependent weight used in the proximal objective at step <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> is the score-model denoised prediction of the clean sample at step <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> (before enforcing data consistency); <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> is the solution of the data-proximal subproblem at step <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> (i.e., the data-consistent refinement of <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>); <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m10" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\hat{\bm{\epsilon}}=\big(1-\alpha_{i}\big)^{-1/2}\left(\mathbf{x}_{i}-\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{i}},\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϵ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msqrt><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></msqrt><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\bm{\epsilon}}=\big(1-\alpha_{i}\big)^{-1/2}\left(\mathbf{x}_{i}-\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{i}},\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> is the effective noise estimate implied by <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\mathbf{x}_{i},\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mathbf{x}_{i},\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0})</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\epsilon}_{i}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0},\mathbf{I})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐈</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\epsilon}_{i}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0},\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math> is the fresh Gaussian noise injected at step <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\zeta\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\zeta\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> mixes deterministic and stochastic updates in the reverse diffusion (<math id="A1.SS8.p3.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\zeta=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\zeta=0</annotation></semantics></math> fully deterministic, <math id="A1.SS8.p3.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\zeta=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ζ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\zeta=1</annotation></semantics></math> fully stochastic).</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg8" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle ltx_framed ltx_framed_top" style="width:165.6pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg8.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 8</span> </span> DiffPIR Sampling</figcaption>
<div id="alg8.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg8.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg8.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
              
              
            <math id="alg8.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N,\;\mathbf{H},\;\mathbf{y},\;\sigma_{n},\;\{\tilde{\sigma}_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N},\;\zeta,\;\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">N</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em" rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐇</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em" rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐲</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em" rspace="0.447em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">σ</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">n</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.800em" rspace="0.447em">,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">N</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.800em" rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">ζ</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em" rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N,\;\mathbf{H},\;\mathbf{y},\;\sigma_{n},\;\{\tilde{\sigma}_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N},\;\zeta,\;\lambda</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg8.l1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg8.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg8.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg8.l2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Precompute </span><math id="alg8.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho_{i}\leftarrow\lambda\,\sigma_{n}^{2}/\tilde{\sigma}_{i}^{\,2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">ρ</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.800em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.800em">σ</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">n</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em">2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">σ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi><mn mathsize="0.800em"> 2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho_{i}\leftarrow\lambda\,\sigma_{n}^{2}/\tilde{\sigma}_{i}^{\,2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg8.l2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> for </span><math id="alg8.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1,\dots,N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></mrow><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1,\dots,N</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg8.l2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg8.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg8.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
              
              
            <math id="alg8.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{N}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0},\mathbf{I})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐱</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">N</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.800em">∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.800em">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mn mathsize="0.800em">𝟎</mn><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐈</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{N}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0},\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg8.l3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg8.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg8.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg8.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">for</span><span id="alg8.l4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><math id="alg8.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=N,\dots,1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em">=</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">N</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.800em">1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=N,\dots,1</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg8.l4.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="alg8.l4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">do</span><span id="alg8.l4.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg8.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg8.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg8.l5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">   </span><math id="alg8.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\mathbf{s}}\leftarrow\mathbf{s}_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{i},i)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐬</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo mathsize="0.800em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐬</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐱</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.800em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\mathbf{s}}\leftarrow\mathbf{s}_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{i},i)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg8.l5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg8.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg8.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg8.l6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">   </span><math id="alg8.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}\leftarrow\frac{1}{\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{i}}}\!\left(\mathbf{x}_{i}+(1-\bar{\alpha}_{i})\hat{\mathbf{s}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mn mathsize="0.800em">0</mn><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.800em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.800em">1</mn><msqrt><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐱</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.800em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐬</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}\leftarrow\frac{1}{\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{i}}}\!\left(\mathbf{x}_{i}+(1-\bar{\alpha}_{i})\hat{\mathbf{s}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg8.l6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg8.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg8.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg8.l7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">   </span><math id="alg8.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}\leftarrow\arg\min_{\mathbf{x}}\;\|\mathbf{y}-\mathbf{H}\mathbf{x}\|_{2}^{2}+\rho_{i}\|\mathbf{x}-\tilde{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}\|_{2}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn mathsize="0.800em">0</mn><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.800em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">min</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐱</mi></msub><mo>⁡</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐲</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐇𝐱</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.800em">2</mn><mn mathsize="0.800em">2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.800em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">ρ</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐱</mi><mo mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐱</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mn mathsize="0.800em">0</mn><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.800em">2</mn><mn mathsize="0.800em">2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}\leftarrow\arg\min_{\mathbf{x}}\;\|\mathbf{y}-\mathbf{H}\mathbf{x}\|_{2}^{2}+\rho_{i}\|\mathbf{x}-\tilde{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}\|_{2}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg8.l7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg8.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg8.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg8.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">   </span><math id="alg8.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\bm{\epsilon}}\leftarrow\frac{1}{\sqrt{1-\alpha_{i}}}\!\left(\mathbf{x}_{i}-\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{i}}\,\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathsize="0.800em" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϵ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo mathsize="0.800em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.800em">1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn mathsize="0.800em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">α</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐱</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.800em">−</mo><mrow><msqrt><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi></msub></msqrt><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.800em">𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn mathsize="0.800em">0</mn><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\bm{\epsilon}}\leftarrow\frac{1}{\sqrt{1-\alpha_{i}}}\!\left(\mathbf{x}_{i}-\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{i}}\,\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}\right)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg8.l8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg8.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg8.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
              
              
