mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{i-1}\leftarrow\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{i-1}}\,\hat{\mathbf{x}}^{(i)}_{0}+\sqrt{1-\bar{\alpha}_{i-1}}\big(\sqrt{1-\zeta}\,\hat{\bm{\epsilon}}+\sqrt{\zeta}\,\bm{\epsilon}_{i}\big)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg8.l10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
